					<p class="body1" align="left"><span class="body1 style73"> <h2>News archive</h2><strong><font color="#333300" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif" size="2">2007-12-07 | Friday</font></strong><br><br><span style="font-family: Times; font-size: 16px" class="Apple-style-span"><div style="font-family: Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10px; background-color: #ffffff"><span style="color: #333300" class="Apple-style-span"><strong><div>Macklemore<span style="font-weight: normal" class="Apple-style-span">&nbsp;headlines&nbsp;</span>Chop Suey&nbsp;<span style="font-weight: normal" class="Apple-style-span">in Seattle tonight - his last show in the town for a minute before he&#39;s off to complete his new album and rock stages from the West Coast to Western Europe. Fellow&nbsp;</span>Good Medicine<span style="font-weight: normal" class="Apple-style-span">&nbsp;man&nbsp;</span>Gabriel Teodros&nbsp;<span style="font-weight: normal" class="Apple-style-span">will be rocking some new joints</span><span style="font-weight: normal" class="Apple-style-span">, and&nbsp;</span>Rajnii Eddins &amp; Language Arts<span style="font-weight: normal" class="Apple-style-span">,&nbsp;</span>Knowmads&nbsp;<span style="font-weight: normal" class="Apple-style-span">and</span>&nbsp;Hella Maze<span style="font-weight: normal" class="Apple-style-span">&nbsp;round out this solid line-up.&nbsp;</span></div><div><br /></div>FRIDAY<br />DECEMBER 07,2007</strong><br />Macklemore<br />Gabriel Teodros<br />Rajnii Eddins &amp; Language Arts<br />KnowMads<br />Hella Maze<br />DJ Marc Sense<br /><br />8PM<br />$7 adv. :: ALL AGES<br />http://www.ticketweb.com<br /><br />Chop Suey<br />1425 E. Madison St.<br />Seattle, WA</span></div></span><p></p><br><hr align="center" noshade size="1" width="400"><br><strong><font color="#333300" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif" size="2">2007-12-07 | Friday</font></strong><br><br><img src="http://farm3.static.flickr.com/2302/2088028642_894ce2f8f1.jpg" alt="" width="409" height="500" /><br /><br />

